surprising given the amount of geopolitical uncertainty still circulating. The S&amp;P 500 is sitting

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:13.480
at 6,581 up a respectable 1.1% on the session. The NASDAQ composite pushed even harder reaching 21,947

