and gaining 1.4%, while here in Canada the TSX composite has been the strongest of the bunch,

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:26.500
hitting 31,884 and posting a solid 1.8% gain. On the surface, these are healthy moves.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:31.440
But when you dig a layer deeper, today's environment is a perfect case study and why we must be

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:37.300
extremely disciplined about when we actually deploy fresh capital. Geopolitical jitters around Iran

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:43.040
